        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: Lionheart (1990 film)\n- People: Jean-Claude Van Damme, Sheldon Lettich, Brian Thompson, Harrison Page, Deborah Rennard, Lisa Pelikan, Ashley Johnson\n- Topics: alternate film titles, acting, martial arts films\n\nFacts:\n- Jean-Claude Camille François Van Varenberg was born on 18 October 1960 and is professionally known as Jean-Claude Van Damme, or JCVD.\n- Jean-Claude Van Damme is a Belgian actor, martial artist, screenwriter, film producer, and director known for martial arts action films.\n- Lionheart is a 1990 action film directed by Sheldon Lettich.\n- Lionheart is also known by the titles Wrong Bet, A.W.O.L.: Absent Without Leave, Leon, and Full Contact.\n- Lionheart stars Jean-Claude Van Damme and co-stars Brian Thompson, Harrison Page, Deborah Rennard, Lisa Pelikan, and Ashley Johnson.",
